<title>UK: M.Y. up on managing director share purchase.</title>
<headline>M.Y. up on managing director share purchase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in M.Y. Holdings Plc rose on Friday as the company said its managing director John Monks increased his stake in the packaging group.</p>
<p>M.Y. said Monks bought 10,000 shares at 87p per share, taking his take to 92,130 or 0.07 percent of the issued share capital.</p>
<p>The stock was up 7p or 7.9 percent at 96 by 1057 GMT in volume of 47,131 shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
